1. 🔍 Single ASIN 360° History & Conflict Checker
Kyun zaroori hai? Baaz dafa ek hi ASIN multiple companies mein apply hoti hai, ya team ko check karna hota hai ke yeh ASIN pehle kisi company mein Ungate hui ya Reject hui?
Feature: Ek search box jahan sirf ASIN dalein (e.g. B08N5WRWNW):
Us ASIN ki mukammal history samne aa jaye (Kis company ne kab apply kiya, kis supplier ki invoice thi, Case ID kya tha, aur result kya nikla).
Agar duplicate ya conflicting status ho (e.g. ek jagah Approved aur doosri jagah Rejected) to warning alert dikhaye.

2. 📦 Supplier Intelligence & Success Scorecard
Kyun zaroori hai? Ungating mein sab se ahem cheez hoti hai ke konsa supplier accept ho raha hai aur konsa reject.
Feature: Ek dedicated Supplier ranking widget:
Top 5 Best Suppliers (90%+ Approval Rate — jaise DEBROX, Target, etc.).
High Risk Suppliers (jinki invoices Amazon zyada reject kar raha hai).
Category-wise Best Supplier recommendation (e.g. Beauty ke liye konsa supplier best hai, Grocery ke liye konsa).

3. 🌙 Shift Productivity & Turnaround Time (5 PM – 1 AM Analytics)
Kyun zaroori hai? Aapne jo 5 PM to 1 AM shift ka rule set kiya hai, uski live team performance dekhne ke liye.
Feature:
Shift Date ke hisab se daily output (kitni entries hui, kitne case reopen hue).
Status Time se Case Activity Time ka response speed / time difference.

